  "description": "The wife he thought was ordinary turns out to be a killer?! One day, Lee Man discovers his wife's affair and, convinced she's plotting to kill him, attempts to kill her first. However, Lee Man witnesses her murder at the hands of a man and becomes the target for killers...\n\nHired to protect Lee Man, the killer \"Movie Gwang\" must find her killer to survive and to learn about his \"real\" wife!\n\nA spectacular revenge action thriller about two newlyweds!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
